RecipePackingTest
├── Packed operands
│   ├── Adds arbitrary uint216 literals
│   ├── Preserves full uint256 inputs and earlier results
│   ├── Accepts the maximum literal and input
│   └── Decodes the third packed MulDiv operand
├── Packed bindings
│   ├── Preserves full uint256 words in queries and calls
│   ├── Keeps offset bits separate from the source byte
│   └── Rejects invalid sources and the maximum out-of-bounds uint32 offset
└── Malformed encodings
    ├── Rejects invalid source and operation bytes
    ├── Rejects empty steps and truncated payloads
    └── Rejects the maximum input and result indices
